# layouts/default — the default composition.
#
# A layout is an interpreted list of airline composition commands (adapter/segment
# only — no palette, so it stays orthogonal to whatever palette is active). `layout
# use default` runs these; `apply` re-runs the stored layout to re-apply.
#
# The default is dependency-free: just the built-in segment set, no plugin adapters.

segment use default
